# Shared library metadata: malloc is a real body, so it shows up as a
# func row for libc.so.6 alongside the strlen IFUNC stub. The anchor rules
# out prefix rows like malloc_stats that sort earlier in the listing.
# REQUIRES: x86_64, system-libc
# RUN: perf info /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6 -e kind,name 2>&1 | %FileCheck %s
# CHECK-NOT: Traceback
# CHECK: kind name
# CHECK: func malloc{{( |$)}}
# CHECK-NOT: Traceback
